Common Issues and Solutions
Issue: User Cannot See Expected Templates
Solution:

Check team membership
Verify template permissions are correctly assigned
Ensure organization permissions are set
Issue: Job Fails with Permission Errors
Solution:

Verify credential permissions
Check inventory access rights
Ensure proper escalation privileges
Issue: Survey Not Displaying
Solution:

Confirm survey is enabled on the template
Check that user has execute permissions
Verify survey questions are properly configured
