Key Takeaways
Job Templates provide a standardized way to execute Ansible playbooks with consistent parameters and security controls. They serve as the foundation for automation governance in enterprise environments.

Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) is crucial for maintaining security and operational boundaries in automation platforms. Proper RBAC implementation ensures that users can only perform actions appropriate to their role and responsibilities.

Permission Testing is essential to validate that access controls work as intended. Regular testing helps identify security gaps and ensures compliance with organizational policies.

